    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδᾰμ-ῇ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nowhere, in no place</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδαμῇ ἐστήρικτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					218
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				385
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. ἄλλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.116
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλῃ οὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.114
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. Αἰγύπτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in no direction, no way</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.24
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				34
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				56
			</span></i>, etc. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐθαμεῖ</span>).</div>
